clinical variables. We identified a robust WM volume abnormality in BD patients that may represent a trait
marker of the disease and used a novel methodology to validate the findings",http://www.bipolardatabase.org,False,2018-02-21T01:50:14.661462+01:00,2018-06-30T10:36:27.901068+02:00,2018-02-21T01:50:14.660932+01:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,True,Bipolar Disorder compared to healthy controls,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,SDM,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,[]
