ement check on fMRI, registration check",False,,False,,True,,,,,,True,FSL,linear,,,,T1,True,BBR,mni,,2.0,True,Gaussian kernel with a FWHM,5.0,2.0,GLM,,,double-Gamma HRF convolution,True,,True,False,,,True,"Gaussian-weighted least-squares straight line fitting, 90secs",FILM with local autocorrelation correction (Woolrich 2001),"Group analysis was carried out using FLAME (FMRIB's Local Analysis of Mixed Effects) stage 1 with automatic outlier detection (Beckmann et al., 2003, Woolrich et al., 2004). ",,,,,True,"For two maps in this collection (with 'phase' in the name),  longitudinal data of two runs was used (prenatal and postnatal phases of fatherhood), with within design specified by giving both runs a 1",,,,,,[1]
