3952,http://neurovault.org/collections/3952/,http://neurovault.org/collections/3952/download,1220,,taehol,2,Love flows downstream: mothers’ and children’s neural representation similarity in perceiving distress of self and family,,10.1093/scan/nsx125,,"Tae-Ho Lee, Yang Qu and Eva H Telzer",http://academic.oup.com/scan/article/12/12/1916/4562429,Social Cognitive and Affective Neuroscience,"The current study aimed to capture empathy processing in an interpersonal context. Mother–adolescent dyads (N 1⁄4 22)
