3245,http://neurovault.org/collections/3245/,http://neurovault.org/collections/3245/download,355,,shackman,12,Intrinsic functional connectivity of the central extended amygdala,,10.1002/hbm.23917,,"Rachael M. Tillman, Melissa D. Stockbridge, Brendon M. Nacewicz, Salvatore Torrisi, Andrew S. Fox, Jason F. Smith and Alexander J. Shackman",http://doi.wiley.com/10.1002/hbm.23917,Human Brain Mapping,"Citation: Tillman, R. M., Stockbridge, M. D., Nacewicz, B. M., Torrisi, S., Fox, A. S., Smith, J. F., & Shackman, A. J. (2017). Intrinsic functional connectivity of the central extended amygdala. Human Brain Mapping.

