5046,http://neurovault.org/collections/5046/,http://neurovault.org/collections/5046/download,2130,,christoph.w.korn,7,Minimizing threat via heuristic and optimal policies recruits hippocampus and medial prefrontal cortex,,10.1038/s41562-019-0603-9,,Christoph W. Korn and Dominik R. Bach,http://www.nature.com/articles/s41562-019-0603-9,Nature Human Behaviour,"Abstract of the article:
