-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains outputs from group level analyses used in published work. Volumes include inputs and outputs to whole brain group-level analyses with FSL's RANDOMISE. 
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files are named according to organization; there are three types of group level tests included. (1)  Files beginning with 'endorse-gt-oppose_' or  'oppose-gt-endorse_'   are between-groups RANDOMISE tests. (2) files beginning with 'all-subjects_' are group-level analyses collapsed across both groups. (3) Files beginning with 'pergroup-endorse_' or 'pergroup_oppose_' are group analyses per each group (that is, not in contrast with the other group). 
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The second part of each file name contains information about what each contrast is. See OSF wiki linked below for information about contrasts (CONTRAST LABELS ARE DEFINED AND DESCRIBED UNDER THE MASTER PAGE FILES, ''expt_design_info.pdf"" .) There are eleven contrasts in total, though note that for the 'all-subjects_' files, only three primary contrasts are analyzed and included. 
