Lgain-Lloss: Large Gain ($5) > Large Loss (-$5)
Lloss-Neut: Large Loss (-$5) > Neutral (no money at stake)
LSloss-Neut: Large Loss (-$5, .5) & Small Loss (-$0.20, .5) > Neutral (no money at stake)
Lloss-Lgain: Large Loss (-$5) > Large Gain ($5)

