12625,http://neurovault.org/collections/12625/,http://neurovault.org/collections/12625/download,16077,,severi.sant,6,Reward responses to vicarious feeding depend on BMI,,,,,,,"The repository contains population level neuroimaging results published in the original research article ""Reward responses to vicarious feeding depend on BMI"" (https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2024.06.20.599673v1). The repository contains unthresholded T-maps for perceiving eating and standing as well as for the contrast between eating and standing. The results also include unthresholded  T-maps for the modulatory effect of BMI to these same contrasts.",,False,2022-06-08T14:31:16.730119+02:00,2025-01-08T12:04:26.177141+01:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,[]
